{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/852702-wonder-woman-is-so-very-solar","id":852702,"title":"Wonder Woman is so very Solar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-24T17:51:55-07:00","id":852702,"title":"Wonder Woman is so very Solar","content":"Just saw Bats v Supes, and I don't want to say much because spoilers and all, but I will say that even without much screen time, Wonder Woman was exceptionally bad ass and very, very Solar.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure the internet and all other media spoiled the fact of her inclusion months ago so I don't think that's really a spoiler on it's own.<br /> <br /> Also in general I think the movie was more &quot;Exalt-y&quot; than much of the MCU, in tone as well as content.<br /> <br /> Man, now I'm excited for the WW movie...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","user":"Blackwell","date":". 03-24-2016, 09:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T18:34:48-07:00","id":852725,"title":"","content":"Well not really a spoiler considering way way back when they were talking about how Wonderwoman would be in the movie. So was it any good? I've got a friend going to see it tomorrow and she's kind of worried about it considering she despised Man of Steel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T18:43:33-07:00","id":852732,"title":"","content":"She should be: she's probably the most Exalted-esque of the Justice League in terms of her background and stories (fighting Greek gods and monsters).<br /> <br /> But yeah, was the film actually any good? Because in my experience Superman films aren't, and it got really bad scores from critics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-24T19:41:40-07:00","id":852758,"title":"","content":"I definitely think the overall negative reviews are unfair. There was a lot about it I liked. A few issues, but overall a good time. Much better than Man of Steel. And Affleck was actually really good as Batman. Different big-screen portrayal of the character but in many ways closer to the source material than previous Batmans. If the Arkham universe Batman got a feature film, it would look a lot like this. My complaints are pretty specific so I don't want to discuss them until more people have seen it.<br /> <br /> Edit: And when I say Wonder Woman is very Solar, I don't just mean &quot;greek-inflected superhero&quot;, I mean short of, like, an anima banner you could have plucked her out of 3e.<br /> <br /> Edit edit: Full disclosure, the reason I got to see it early is because I work for a division of WB, though not one with any connection to the movie.","signature":"","edi